      "translation_chunk_count": 4,
      "translation_input": "一座高原试验站依靠太阳能阵列、锂电池和小型柴油发电机供电。微电网需要持续支持诊所、无线电中继、气象设备和安全照明。冬季道路可能封闭数日，网络也不稳定，因此本地控制器每二百毫秒采集电压、电流、温度与振动数据，并在能源不足时优先保障医疗和通信负载。完整记录保存在站内，只有压缩后的状态摘要会在链路恢复时发送到控制中心。",
      "translated_text": "A plateau test station relies on solar arrays, lithium batteries and a small diesel generator to power it. Micro-grids need to continue to support clinics, radio relay, weather equipment and safety lighting. Roads can be closed for days in winter and the network is unstable, so local controllers collect voltage, current, temperature and vibration data every 200 milliseconds, and prioritize medical and communications loads when energy is scarce. The complete record is stored on the station, and only the compressed status summary is sent to the control center when the link is restored.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "A plateau test station relies on solar arrays, lithium batteries and a small diesel generator to power it. Micro-grids need to continue to support clinics, radio relay, weather equipment and safety lighting. Roads can be closed for days in winter and the network is unstable, so local controllers collect voltage, current, temperature and vibration data every 200 milliseconds, and prioritize medical and communications loads when energy is scarce. The complete record is stored on the station, and only the compressed status summary is sent to the control center when the link is restored.",
      "spell_changes": []
    },
