      "translation_input": "2025年十月十八日，一场沙尘风暴使太阳能输出在十五分钟内下降百分之三十四，电池柜温度升高八摄氏度，逆变器风扇还出现异常低频振动。控制器没有关闭整座电站，而是断开非必要加热装置、降低部分照明功率并启动备用发电机。诊断模块随后提出三个可能原因：太阳能板被碎屑遮挡、风扇轴承磨损，以及电池连接器的接触电阻上升。",
      "translated_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm caused a 34 percent drop in solar output in fifteen minutes, a temperature rise of eight degrees Celsius in the battery cabinet, and an abnormally low frequency vibration in the inverter fan. Instead of shutting down the entire power plant, the controller disconnects unnecessary heating devices, lowers the power of some lighting and starts the backup generator. Diagnostic modules then suggested three possible causes: solar panels were shrouded in debris, fan bearings wore out, and the contact resistance of the battery connector rose.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm caused a 34 percent drop in solar output in fifteen minutes, a temperature rise of eight degrees Celsius in the battery cabinet, and an abnormally low frequency vibration in the inverter fan. Instead of shutting down the entire power plant, the controller disconnects unnecessary heating devices, lowers the power of some lighting and starts the backup generator. Diagnostic modules then suggested three possible causes: solar panels were shrouded in debris, fan bearings wore out, and the contact resistance of the battery connector rose.",
      "spell_changes": []
    },
